	<item>
		<title><![CDATA[VideoPress Download]]></title>
		<dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
		<content:encoded><![CDATA[<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>The <strong>VideoPress Download</strong> block adds a download link for a VideoPress video on the same page. In the editor it reads the video’s GUID and file URL from the VideoPress block; when a page has more than one VideoPress block, a <em>Select a VideoPress block</em> panel in the block settings picks which one.</p>
<!-- /wp:paragraph -->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Downloads allowed</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:videopress/video {"title":"jetpack-golden-token","guid":"oSlNIBQO","src":"https://videos.files.wordpress.com/oSlNIBQO/jetpack-golden-token.mp4","videoRatio":100} /-->

<!-- wp:wpcomsp/videopress-download {"text":"Download this video","guid":"oSlNIBQO","src":"https://videos.files.wordpress.com/oSlNIBQO/jetpack-golden-token.mp4","style":{"spacing":{"padding":{"top":"var:preset|spacing|20","bottom":"var:preset|spacing|20","left":"var:preset|spacing|30","right":"var:preset|spacing|30"}}},"backgroundColor":"contrast","textColor":"base"} /-->

<!-- wp:heading -->
<h2 class="wp-block-heading">Downloads turned off</h2>
<!-- /wp:heading -->

<!-- wp:paragraph -->
<p>This video does not allow downloads, so the VideoPress Download block placed under it renders nothing here. In the editor, the block shows “Download is disabled for this video”.</p>
